{"id":"bc4e5281ef843896","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-poset-monotone-map.md","title":"ZFC Poset Monotone Map","display":"df-zfc-poset-monotone-map — ZFC Poset Monotone Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-monotone-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-monotone-map"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-monotone-map — ZFC Poset Monotone Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-monotone-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-monotone-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-monotone-map — ZFC Poset Monotone Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,P,Q\\in V\">\\(f,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,P,Q\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q=\\langle Q,\\leq_Q\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb Q=\\langle Q,\\leq_Q\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_Q\\subseteq Q\\times Q\">\\(\\leq_Q\\subseteq Q\\times Q\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the poset and total-function predicates (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetMonotoneMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetMonotoneMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}monotone\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetMonotoneMap}_S(f,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathbb Q=\\langle Q,\\leq_Q\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_Py\\to f(x)\\leq_Qf(y))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}monotone\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetMonotoneMap}_S(f,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathbb Q=\\langle Q,\\leq_Q\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_Py\\to f(x)\\leq_Qf(y))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ are the poset and total-function predicates (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ are the poset and total-function predicates (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q,P,Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q=\\langle Q,\\leq_Q\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_Q\\subs